    "Partial investigation, using anonymous public sources only. Fusion event history is receipt-corroborated; arbitrary pinned Fusion balances and restrictions remain unavailable.",
    "Five candidate vaults on six source chains do not establish exhaustive custody. NEAR, Harmony, Energi and Sora representations remain discovery leads.",
